The monospace fonts the app can wear (pick one in the app's Settings, or with
`amarchy theme --font`). Each is the Nerd Fonts build of the font (its icons
are the ones amarchy's list draws), regular and bold, converted to WOFF2 for
the browser. Nothing else about them is changed.

jetbrains-mono/   JetBrainsMono Nerd Font, Omarchy's font
  JetBrains Mono 2.304, by The JetBrains Mono Project Authors.
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL.txt). https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono

caskaydia-mono/   CaskaydiaMono Nerd Font
  Cascadia Mono, by Microsoft Corporation ("Cascadia Code" is its Reserved
  Font Name, hence Nerd Fonts' "Caskaydia"). SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (OFL.txt). https://github.com/microsoft/cascadia-code

fira-code/        FiraCode Nerd Font
  Fira Code, by The Fira Code Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (OFL.txt). https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode

